I am standing by the window.
The glass is cold.
It is January.
I look out.
Copenhagen is grey today.
It is cold outside.
There is ice on the street.
But it is warm here.
The apartment is good.
I think about Mexico.
In Mexico, there is sun.
It is also warm there.
I miss the sun a little.
But I smile.
It is a new city.
I am in Denmark now.
It is a good start.
